  "intent_snapshot": {
    "contract": "assurance_kernel/task_intent/v1",
    "task_id": "wc-host-neutral-contract-tool-names",
    "goal": "Make the packaged Immune-Brain contracts Host-neutral about tool identity: remove the stale freeze_artifacts instruction the Kernel already performs internally, replace Pi-only tool names with the obligation they stand for, and add a focused guard so no packaged contract can again name a tool that is absent from the invoking Host's surface.",
    "acceptance": [
      {
        "id": "HTN-1",
        "assertion": "No packaged contract under plugins/immune-brain/dist/ instructs a Host to call a tool that does not exist on that Host: the freeze_artifacts step is removed from imm-loop.md because runtime/assurance/coordinator.ts already performs artifact freeze inside advance_assurance, and every remaining imm_kernel_canary / imm_loop_action reference in imm-loop.md, imm-planner.md, and imm-review-retro.md is restated as the Host-neutral obligation instead of a single Host's tool spelling. No Host gains or loses a tool.",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v1\",\n  \"runner_id\": \"bun\",\n  \"runner_version\": \"1.3.14\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"test\",\n    \"tests/packaged-contract-tool-surface.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \".\",\n  \"timeout_ms\": 60000,\n  \"max_output_bytes\": 20000\n}\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "HTN-2",
        "assertion": "A new focused contract test tests/packaged-contract-tool-surface.test.ts enumerates every tool identifier appearing in the packaged contracts and fails unless each one is registered on at least one Host tool surface (runtime/claude/mcp_server.ts for Claude Code, the Pi extension registration for Pi). The test fails against the pre-change contracts, which is the evidence that it catches the regression it names.",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v1\",\n  \"runner_id\": \"bun\",\n  \"runner_version\": \"1.3.14\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"test\",\n    \"tests/packaged-contract-tool-surface.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \".\",\n  \"timeout_ms\": 60000,\n  \"max_output_bytes\": 20000\n}\n"
      },
