        "assertion": "The doc pipeline stays consistent after the edits: the three files remain SKILL_OWNED_ENTRIES in scripts/dist-sync-manifest.ts, their minimal skills/*/SKILL.md loaders are unchanged, and the existing dist sync and skill consistency guards still pass.",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v1\",\n  \"runner_id\": \"bun\",\n  \"runner_version\": \"1.3.14\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"test\",\n    \"tests/dist-docs-sync-contract.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/skill-dist-consistency.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \".\",\n  \"timeout_ms\": 120000,\n  \"max_output_bytes\": 20000\n}\n"
